Keep ppt-master user data outside the grafted Skill directory.

- Resolve editable Brand/Style/Layout/Deck libraries through
  PPT_MASTER_TEMPLATES_DIR, including registration and Confirm UI discovery.
- Resolve default project workspaces and source-move boundaries through
  PPT_MASTER_PROJECTS_DIR, including Native Enhance.
- Keep bundled templates, icons, charts, schemas, and scaffolds read-only.
- Preserve env-free --help and explicit project-directory overrides.
- Use uv for commands in the workflows touched by this adaptation.

